{"id":"W12f2229dd4d5087592e238c8","zh":"","en":"PDF","name":"PDF","language":"en","domain":"统计与概率","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"与累计分布函数分开。概率密度在某一点的数值不能直接当作该点发生的概率；PDF在这里是统计缩写。","usage_overview":"用于描述不平顺幅值、谱值、模型参数及动力响应的随机分布，比较不同模型或工况的统计差异，并据此计算统计量、限值内概率与可靠度；在瞬态分析中，还需关注分布随时间或状态的演化。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W12f2229dd4d5087592e238c8","text":"PDF","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S99202ad2e65e9500c821","source_id":"P003","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"en","text":"A PDF comparison between the simulation and measurement is presented in Fig. 4 .","citations":[{"source_id":"P003","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S1fa865160eaee1d49aae","source_id":"P003","page":11,"page_end":11,"language":"en","text":"The PDF evolution of the lateral acceleration of the car body against a portion of time is depicted in Fig. 9 .","citations":[{"source_id":"P003","page":11,"page_end":11}]},{"id":"S4219c496d33b6d3a9d63","source_id":"P111","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"从各动力指标的PDF分布可以较为方便地得到各指标动力响应的极值、是否超限及超限概率等信息。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S3a90760df061051e5cfc","source_id":"P111","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"为了考察横风对轨道系统的影响,图8给出了背风侧钢轨横向位移和加速度、迎风侧钢轨垂向位移、轨道板横向位移的PDF分布。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S6ca9b309fd66f50d587a","source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"概率密度函数(PDF)抓住了随机动力响应幅值和概率两方面的特性,是分析随机振动统计信息的有力工具,也是动力可靠度计算的基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P